HELD BACK FROM PRODUCTION — Seth, 2026-09-05.

While this file exists, apps/consent/deploy.sh exits without deploying whenever the branch is
productionWeb, so consent.flextext.app stays at the build it already serves (the v566 port from the
2026-09-02 bootstrap). Preview and staging uploads are unaffected.

Both production paths honour it — the "Deploy to production" Actions workflow (deploy-apps.yml runs
this deploy.sh) and a Cloudflare git-connected build, whose deploy command is also `bash deploy.sh`.

To release the consent collector: delete this file, commit, and push productionWeb as usual.
